#: scenario:scenario_3DC3D75D_8477_449F_9C3C_84273E47D26F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebe747d01cc5154a3f3497c0c03d6e34ab1e79a9fc68ad1a15a8ff3b0fe0dac8
