msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DC3D75D_8477_449F_9C3C_84273E47D26F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sun shone fiercely down on the town that day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O sol brilhou ferozmente sobre a cidade naquele dia."

#: scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa932c998cb078f6a48a27b9f4c111b08a4cc076a34ad7c147e7bd4231968da5
#. default-sha256: c712c459d035942e88f0d0c1f5027d8b8069b9131491f09019e103d8cffe7424
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As was characteristic of the area, cloudy days and rain were frequent during this season, "
"but the sun almost always took the stage the day after a storm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como era característico da região, os dias nublados e a chuva eram frequentes nesta estação, "
"mas o sol quase sempre tomava o palco no dia seguinte a uma tempestade."

#: scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f494109189859f8a302ceb4da75a729a6d40760df53bfe3292566f17766adf26
#. default-sha256: 3402372d9e1eb589224a2dd311ba86a24f915d8c575212a4d1aff5ca7e414970
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cathedral standing tall in the center of town.⟪k:1⟫The stone-paved streets clacking with "
"the pleasant sound of footsteps.⟪k:2⟫The people peering out from beneath awnings to look up at "
"the sky."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A catedral erguendo-se alta no centro da cidade.⟪k:1⟫As ruas pavimentadas de pedra estalando "
"com o som agradável de passos.⟪k:2⟫As pessoas espiando por baixo dos toldos para olhar para o céu."

#: scenario:scenario_FA7DB5A1_352F_468E_9A39_B7387CAAB96F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c3ae452fdb339b40e865b867ac603afeb8cfcb96529d9e4629cde3dc0313c44
