"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Elsewhere—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫back at the mansion,⟪k:9⟫Nellie was "
"causing trouble for the abigails."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Em outro lugar-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫de volta à mansão,⟪k:9⟫Nellie estava "
"causando problemas para as Abigails."

#: scenario:scenario_56FADCA6_47A7_43DC_AE0D_3762B6682432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06a1621ce38c34fd152c848b1e9a22557d786a8049606ab19ad09c6ea2334f70
#. default-sha256: fafd8baadfacfdf18f5520e44341dba831d28b8856386097d18a13f6b38da236
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56FADCA6_47A7_43DC_AE0D_3762B6682432"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On a whim, she had decided to redecorate her bedchamber, so she gathered the maids and put "
"them to work, shouting orders and demands and complaints."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por um capricho, ela decidiu redecorar seu quarto, então reuniu as criadas e as colocou para "
"trabalhar, gritando ordens, demandas e reclamações."

#: scenario:scenario_7BF2CCDF_724E_4FC0_A216_50B4B754228A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86d7e37f70b13768ca4abaab696e9923172f3ea50bcbb60256049dc1d87da000
