msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫No, not like that! How many times must I tell you?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Não, assim não! Quantas vezes devo te dizer?!"

#: scenario:scenario_7028109B_CC5D_4B0E_9059_F147BB0704AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcd7cad418c81a02b880b04eb7b03509676d94f082d178701e7f3da81ca737c7
