msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7028109B_CC5D_4B0E_9059_F147BB0704AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tapestry goes by the door!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And I ⟪k:3⟫don’t⟪k:4⟫ like the carpet’s pattern.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Is there anything else we can change it with?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A tapeçaria fica perto da porta!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E eu ⟪k:3⟫não⟪k:4⟫ gosto do padrão do tapete.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Tem alguma coisa com a qual possamos trocá-lo?"

#: scenario:scenario_7C0F1664_0F95_4494_82E9_FB82AF0BF61F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37ad6f83de410101a67e249eaee58aa3465eb5f6e871ffb2ae97a0a956f8d54d
#. default-sha256: e9bc68ffa4dc9c5f7f4e8ab8e867b9409f984d736cfad90a3150106b49c53155
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C0F1664_0F95_4494_82E9_FB82AF0BF61F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Who put this ugly vase here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ei! Quem colocou esse vaso feio aqui?!"

#: scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f628f50c58be457ee40159665a9042309ecdaca9fc694ab4df222d106dbcf03
#. default-sha256: d9d4a4fb97601c9e1e10d84aa6c8812af2342f2a862c3a5226ec47f7c7b56b4c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie appeared to be rather irritated,⟪k:1⟫and it was the servants who bore the brunt of "
"her frustration.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though if they found this similarly vexing, none of them showed it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie parecia bastante irritada,⟪k:1⟫e foram as servas que suportaram o peso de sua "
"frustração.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Todavia, se elas achavam isso igualmente irritante, nenhuma delas demonstrou."

#: scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa4455244f88ed72fdd82b1bd23eb24add194722af31b19ffa3853664e8dfabb
#. default-sha256: 127b22ccb385ffa47c68131114a53dd28303cad9036ab05181f4661599bd7d94
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was a girl who spoke her mind—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a trait particular to that time in history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela era uma garota que falava o que pensava...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫uma característica própria daquele "
"momento da história."

#: scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfcd896f540a61208c355a455e133a6bf94739c0e1998ad5e00e6bb24036bf58
#. default-sha256: a5787d4b927e6a9c6d1e0bd2c4be381b00373df4729cbaf1e1a0c44d1cb42a14
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Women of the Golden Age were so vivacious, in fact, that it inspired parody and satire in "
"foreign countries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As mulheres da Era de Ouro eram tão vivazes, de fato, que inspiravam paródia e sátira em "
"países estrangeiros."

#: scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f39a5c46fa06d8060aa44152dbead32dee3a14dca1dff8ffbcd692937ec943e8
#. default-sha256: 8999be4d703413e52e567e5c0bc5a99b3356eb94016a596a0441ce43f2655e13
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no matter how hands-off her parents were, had Nellie been born a generation earlier, or "
"a generation later, she likely would not have been able to act so free-spirited."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas, não importasse o quão despreocupados fossem seus pais, se Nellie tivesse nascido uma "
"geração antes ou uma depois, provavelmente não teria sido capaz de agir com tanta liberdade."

#: scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81a464996eeea8749bc9a7384363c2e0fc2528331489f8b9d52fac747a0e00c9
#. default-sha256: b2b8296c897899cc20c779b78ea57b2261e4c71896f4d4a055609f814b74e849
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That day, however, Nellie did not seem to be her usual self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Naquele dia, no entanto, Nellie não parecia ela mesma."

#: scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab1802b4ac71331572a29a7f456687ee68ce51c9b506bcf0fa0cd865b4cca80b
#. default-sha256: b384725bc53dd9b90b50a1b0008d8335113c03f2a37f0a1bd53ec82b285bb6d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though she always spoke her mind, it rarely went beyond being childishly adorable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora ela sempre falasse o que pensava, raramente ia além de ser infantilmente adorável."

#: scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e6d262570cce93345ca9f54ed5a541a4b262e14c83ce3573a3985f94a9b2a81
#. default-sha256: f699b60fd4aeb462198beed8482361bdaed6fb868b9b505bcfea28e0555b96d5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was unusual to see her in such a foul mood, not even a smile on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era incomum vê-la de tão mau humor, nem mesmo com um sorriso no rosto."

#: scenario:scenario_A206F73E_4111_4666_B544_2A105B09EF95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e474577822671366229dd4cc182e6e00773f03ed6c54fd3110d620fc175b1084
