msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A206F73E_4111_4666_B544_2A105B09EF95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ugh, get rid of all of it!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The carpet, that chair, the desk! It’s all so "
